  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Menu App**\n\nI\'m focusing on simplicity and modern aesthetics for a catering menu application. The core function involves users selecting a menu from options, with the ability to customize quantities based on guest counts. I\'m prioritizing starters, juices, and main courses in the initial design.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Skills & Cuisine**\n\nI\'ve shifted focus to identifying relevant skills for this project. Specifically, I\'m marking \"image-generation\" as a potentially useful but secondary skill to consider after exploring options like Lucide icons or UI styles. My current emphasis also includes ensuring the catering menu features Indian cuisine and allowing quantity customization based on guest counts, with a submit action.\n\n\n**Evaluating Data Storage Needs**\n\nI\'m now diving into the storage aspect. Considering it\'s a client-only app where users construct a menu, calculate quantities, and \"submit\" it for a quote, I\'ve concluded that local storage is sufficient. This aligns perfectly with the \"transient & local storage\" guideline. I\'ll stick to React context and local storage.\n\n\n**Refining User Experience**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user experience, aiming for a single-view, polished React application. The current plan includes custom cards, smooth animations using `motion`, and rich interactivity for guest counts and quantity adjustments. A real-time smart estimator and a beautiful submission summary or invoice receipt drawer are also key. The name of the application will be \"Catering Menu App.\"\n\n\n**Revising Project Naming**\n\nI\'m revisiting the app\'s naming. I\'ve considered names like \"Indian Catering Menu Planner\" and \"Catering Menu Selection,\" finally settling on \"Catering Menu Planner\" as the best fit. I\'m focusing now on project files. I\'ll inspect `package.json` to understand dependencies and architecture. I\'m also doing a skill check to verify needs, prioritizing aesthetics with SVG or CSS, and will steer clear of AI unless explicitly requested.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am going to check the current contents of `metadata.json` to initialize the application metadata properly."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 361109686
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
