    thinking: "**Defining the application scope**\n\nI\'ve decided to call the application \"Indian Catering Menu Planner.\" I\'m also planning to describe it as \"an aesthetic and modern catering menu selection application for picking and customizing Indian-cuisine menus based on guest counts.\"\n\n\n**Refining the Font Palette**\n\nI\'m now focusing on typography, planning to import \"Inter\" and a serif font for display text. I\'m thinking of \"Playfair Display\", \"Outfit\", \"Cinzel\", or \"Cormorant Garamond.\" I will update `src/index.css` to include the appropriate `@import` statements and some high-contrast, warm, luxurious colors like saffron, cardamom green, warm clay, charcoal dark gray, and sleek off-white.\n\n\n**Planning the UI Layout**\n\nI\'m now designing a high-quality, responsive single-view layout for the application, and I\'m designing the screens. The application logic will include a header with interactive event configuration elements (guest count, date, event type), followed by tabbed card menus for Indian cuisine categories (starters, beverages, main course, and desserts). Each menu item will have a customizer card with selection and quantity customization options.\n\n\n"
