    modified_response: "I have designed and built a highly polished, aesthetic, and modern Indian catering menu selection application. It allows hosts to craft the perfect dining lineup for any scale of celebration.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Features & Design Layout\n- **Utsav Saffron & Cardamom Theme**: Designed a custom visual scheme using rich saffron golds, soft cardamoms, warm neutrals, and crisp typography to reflect the elegance of Indian hospitality.\n- **Smart Ingredient & Quantity Scale**:\n  - Live adjustment of guest count (10 to 1,000 pax) with instant, reactive scaling.\n  - **Portion Size Scale**: Option to select Light (0.8x), Standard (1.0x), or Heavy (1.3x) servings for individual items.\n  - **Crowd Coverage**: Adjust item portioning dynamically to target 25%, 50%, 75%, or 100% of guests (extremely useful for non-veg items or niche sides).\n- **Cuisine Categories**:\n  - **Starters**: Traditional skewers, tikkas, and crisp pastries (with integrated heat indicators).\n  - **Juices & Refreshers**: Alphonso Mango Lassis, Mint Chaas, and spiced badam milk to welcome guests.\n  - **Main Courses**: Rich paneer butter masala, slow-cooked mutton, and classic bread baskets with flame tandoori rotis.\n  - **Royal Desserts**: Feathery saffron rasmalai, warm gulab jamuns, and rich faloodas.\n- **Interactive Budget Tracker**: Tracks live costs, estimates Taxes, and calculates the cost per guest plate dynamically.\n- **Smart Catering Assistant**: An advisor system that flags warnings or adds helpful recommendations if you have selected too few starters, missed desserts, or have high-risk configurations.\n- **Host Check-out & Print Quote**: Complete order placement modal capturing direct event metadata (dates, host contacts, venue places, special notes) and generating a beautiful client-ready formal quotation with built-in printing support."
