  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented a gorgeous, modern, and simplified **Indian Catering Menu & Plate Planner** with an elegant and aesthetic introductory landing experience.\n\nHere is a summary of the polished outcomes:\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Traditional & Aesthetic Touch\n- **Royal Indian Culinary Palette**: Built using soft, premium off-white canvases paired with warm **Golden Saffron** accents and **Cardamom Green** dietary badges for a clean vegetarian/non-vegetarian contrast.\n- **Aesthetic Landing Intro**: Crafted an immersive start screen celebrating the rich heritage of Indian cuisine, complete with brief highlights (portion sizing, dietary guidelines, customized bill setups) and an interactive **Quick-Selector** for setting initial guest counts, occasion types, and dates.\n- **Graceful Transitions**: Users can quickly toggle and preview menu categories (Appetizers/Starters, Welcome Mocktails, Main Royal Gravies, and Sweets & Rabris) with elegant animations.\n\n### \342\232\226\357\270\217 Smart Portion Calibration\n- **Dynamic Portion Scaling**: The quantity engine automatically multiplies portion scales behind the scenes based on selected multipliers (Light, Standard, and Heavy) to calculate exact portion sizes for the guest count instantly.\n- **Refined Selection Controls**: Added easy-to-use, minimalist incremental switches to finely adjust weights without layout clutter.\n\n### \360\237\223\213 Professional Invoice Slip\n- **Caterer Summary Generation**: Seamlessly locking menus generates an official citation slip containing final average plate spends, total taxes, and printable receipts for instant catering team alignment."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
